<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES OF PLAYERS COMPLETING SECOND ROUND OF U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES OF PLAYERS COMPLETING SECOND ROUND OF U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Maryland 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
